use is.tung
## check `proved` without axioms, or inlook the assumption of `assumed`.
## the unrelated unfinished definition doth not affect either audit.
show ilk truth: * { yes: truth }
show orsetting chosen: truth
show let assumed: truth ≔ chosen
show let soothed: [@α: *, x: α, x = x] ≔ eftbend
let unfinished: truth ≔ sorry
